OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed over crash that
OL,4,Akilled great-grandad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speeding driver has been jailed for
OL,7,Ftwo years after a crash in Leicester
OL,8,Fkilled a great-grandad and seriously
OL,9,Finjured his partner.
OL,11,FAaron Singh-Dhillon was driving at more
OL,12,Fthan 60mph on the A47 Hinckley Road, in
OL,13,Fthe Braunstone area, when he collided
OL,14,Fwith a Suzuki Alto driven by
OL,15,F74-year-old David Hold, police said.
OL,17,FHold had safely pulled out on to the
OL,18,Froad - which has a 40mph limit - from
OL,19,Fthe junction with Avery Hill, the force
OL,20,Fsaid, but Singh-Dhillon was unable to
OL,21,Fslow down in time and hit Hold's Suzuki
OL,22,FAlto.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
